ETHERNET-LAB/1
# Analog capture: force 10BASE-T to observe Manchester encoding.
MAC 02:00:00:00:00:01
PHY 10_HALF

NOTE Prepare the capture
WAIT 2000

NOTE Enlace 10BASE-T
LINK 5000
WAIT 2000

NOTE Configuracion IPv4 por DHCP
DHCP 15000
WAIT 2000

NOTE Resolucion ARP
ARP 192.168.7.1 2000
WAIT 2000

NOTE ICMP with recognizable payloads
PING 192.168.7.1 1 2000 INCREMENT
WAIT 2000
PING 192.168.7.1 1 2000 00
WAIT 2000
PING 192.168.7.1 1 2000 FF
WAIT 2000
PING 192.168.7.1 1 2000 55
WAIT 2000
PING 192.168.7.1 1 2000 AA
WAIT 2000

NOTE Peticion HTTP visible en Wireshark
HTTP_GET 192.168.7.1 80 /
